
>> blue := ['blue'].
>> colors := ਲਿਸਟ ← ['yellow']; ['green']; blue ; ['red']; ['orange']; ['purple']; ['pink'].
>> palette := colors ਸ਼ੁਰੂ: 2 ਲੰਬਾਈ: 3.
ਆਉਟਪੁੱਟ ਲਿਖੋ: (palette ਜੋੜੋ: [',']), ਨਵੀਂ-ਲਾਈਨ. 
